
# ── Contamination-wall guard (added 2026-09-05) ──────────────────────────────
# This is the PUBLIC K9Core repo. The cortex's cognitive layer (CKB) and the
# Personal Evidence Bank (PEB) hold private material and ModernCrete confidential
# data (bid numbers, unit rates, client/project names). They must NEVER be
# published here. These patterns stop an accidental copy from being staged.
# A deliberate `git add -f` still overrides this: the standing rule is that
# CKB/PEB live in the PRIVATE CreteSync repo and encrypted backups only.
ckb/
**/ckb/
peb/
**/peb/
journal.md
session-summaries.md
commits.md
Session-Notes-*.md
